  "description": "For this assignment, I designed a series of three posters, each with a different theme, along with three accompanying derivatives: a flyer, a sticker, and Instagram posts.\n\nThe posters were based on the themes \"Museumnacht\" (Museum Night), \"Inscript\", and a quote of our choice.\n\nFor \"Museumnacht\", I was inspired by nightshops and their glowing LED signs.\n\nFor \"Inscript\", I drew inspiration from early 2000s computer interfaces. This because it is a digital event.\n\nFor the quote, I chose a statement by Bob Marley on racism. I brought a human and emotional element into the design through handwritten typography and visual references to skin.\n\nEach poster explores a different visual language.",
